#ASSERT `s 42(1)(b): the resolution is passed in time` `the test House sitting days` (Date 9 4 2026) (Date 19 5 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Laid on 9 March 2026: notice on the last day allowed, 9 April 2026, then the resolution on the last day allowed after that, 14 May 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day on which a legislative instrument may be disallowed in a House` `the test House sitting days` (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 5 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day on which a legislative instrument may be disallowed in a House` `the test House sitting days` (Date 1 5 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

